{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEMunaLj8tXFKS2MMLVa", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**简短答案:** titi 是门塔威人的传统纹身。它主要有两个作用:\n\n- **身份与地位的标识:** 它是部族的身份象征,某些纹样还标示部族的地界。它也表示一个人的性别、年龄和职务。动物纹样代表狩猎本领。肩部的星形纹和 sibalubalu 纹样表示这人是 sikerei,也就是巫医和精神领袖。\n- **信仰与精神作用:** 门塔威人信奉 Arat Sabulungan,相信万物有灵。纹身因此被看作神圣的,带有魔法和精神意义。纹样取自树叶、动物、太阳等自然事物,象征人与自然的和谐。\n\n搜索结果还提到,titi 已被列为非物质文化遗产。受外来文化和宗教影响,这一传统正在被人放弃。\n\n我只搜了一次,结果多是综述性文章,没有查到更细的仪式资料。\n\nSources:\n- [Tato Mentawai, \"Simbol Keselarasan Alam, dan Identitas Leluhur\" (RRI)](https://rri.co.id/bukittinggi/budaya/2482445/tato-mentawai-simbol-keselarasan-alam-dan-identitas-leluhur)\n- [Upaya Sinuruk Mattaoi dalam Melestarikan Budaya dan Tradisi Mentawai](https://greennetwork.id/gna-knowledge-hub/upaya-sinuruk-mattaoi-dalam-melestarikan-budaya-dan-tradisi-mentawai/)\n- [Jurnal Titik Imaji (UBM)](https://journal.ubm.ac.id/index.php/titik-imaji/article/download/2530/1937)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1777, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4306, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1777}, "output_tokens": 4, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:31:56.608Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEMunGjVx47tZ4KXFmQ6"}
